    "#ovp-lbl + span": "ZCE · DCE", "#h-co": "Top 10 producers by capacity", "#co-p": "The ten largest producers by 2025-26 nameplate capacity. There is no free country output series for PET, so the main column shows capacity, not output, and the other years are blank. Pick a row for the rationale, demand calendar and source.",
    "#co-note": "Mt = million tonnes a year. The 2025 column is nameplate capacity (CCF for China, Polyestertime for the rest), not output. Exports: China's 2026 exports at the Jan-Sep pace (desk annualisation of 4.73 Mt); for others, net exports where reported. The country panel's 'Output' line reads 'not in the pack' because only capacity is available. Risk is a desk score (0-100), not reported data. Taiwan and Oman may rank in the top 10 but are not in the pack.",
