    "#h-md + p": "Six simple models backtested live in your browser on monthly prices since Dec 2018, then blended by their recent accuracy. Next to them, the futures curve: the market's own forecast.", "#mk-p": "Exchange benchmarks converted to $/t, the ZCE PET forward curve, the processing margin and the monthly prices for PET and the feedstocks that drive it.",
